[review] ### Summary
[review] This PR introduces an optional resource-group-scoped balance epoch system for QueryCoord normal balancing, ported from milvus-io/milvus#51431. It adds a full Observe→Plan→Admit→Execute→Reconcile loop per resource group, with snapshot-immutable planning, generation-aware scheduler admission, ambiguous-RPC handling, and retained retry/quarantine. The feature is disabled by default, with shadow-mode support for evaluation. The code structure is rigorous and heavily tested; the upstream final review found zero critical/important/minor findings.
